<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan 1996 export orders up 4.76 percent.</title>
<headline>Taiwan 1996 export orders up 4.76 percent.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign orders for Taiwan goods rose by 4.76 percent to US$119 bln in 1996 compared with 1995, the economics ministry said in an estimate on Monday.</p>
<p>Export orders totalled $10.1 bln in December alone, but the ministry did not say whether the figure was up or down from the same month in 1995.  </p>
<p>-- Taipei newsroom (886-2-508-0815)</p>
</text>
